{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"92457","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/92457","key":"MC-260903","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"10/Mar/23 1:09 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>A less recent attacker than the one that actually caused a player's death can be credited as the killer, appearing in death messages and affecting scoreboards and statistics as mentioned in <a href=\"https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-260903?focusedId=1247640&amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-1247640\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">this comment</a>.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce\"></a>Steps to Reproduce</h3>\n<p>1) Take one hit from a zombie<br>\n2) Take one hit from a husk afterwards<br>\n3) Run /kill</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Observedresult\"></a>Observed result</h3>\n<p>\"Player didn't want to live in the same world as Zombie\"</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedresult\"></a>Expected result</h3>\n<p>\"Player didn't want to live in the same world as Husk\" since the Husk dealt the most recent damage to the player.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"10/Mar/23 9:34 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/120494","id":"120494","filename":"player-test-scoreboard.gif","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/d